2,Where was Nepali language originated? - 2026,https://theflatbkny.com/asia/where-was-nepali-language-originated/,"Which country speak Nepali? Nepali is an Indo-Aryan language, written with the Devanagari script. There are over 17 million Nepali speakers in the world, in countries including Nepal, Bhutan, Myanmar, Brunei and India.",Nepali,Indo-European
