9,Language in Nepal: What languages do they speak in Nepal?,https://haydenrue.com/nepal/language-in-nepal/,"Maithili is Nepal’s second most widely spoken language, with around 11% of the population speaking it as their first language. Maithili is an Indo-Aryan language primarily spoken in Nepal’s Terai region. It is also spoken across the border in the Indian states of Bihar and Jharkhand.",Nepali,Indo-European
